  "description": {
   "en": "Minauchi is depressed by the rumor that his favorite Virtual YouTuber Yumeno Ami has died, but she's announced a new stream, so it must have just been a rumor. Except, during this new stream, she sounds different…\nFeeling betrayed that the real Ami left her fans without saying a word, Minauchi is determined to find the truth.\n\nTranslated by IFLS Scans with the author's consent."
